INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40519, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<With the remains close to the spirit, the howling tone becomes more clear.>$B$BI can feel the end. It is in sight. My vision is no longer blurred and faded mon. You have shown me the way. That cursed Zum\'rah and his magic brought me back from my rest, and left me to wander aimlessly. But I got no grudges mon, for I am free now.$B$BI will find the way, thanks to you.$B$B<The spirit drops a chained necklace onto the sand below, leaving it as a reward as he collects his remains.>', 0),
(40520, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank ya, mon. These supplies won\'t be lasting for long, but they will allow us to live for a few more days at least. Here, take this as a reward mon.', 0),
(40521, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Da ogres will fear da might of our gods. Their vengeance be scary, no mercy be shown. Curse de ogres. Theey will learn not to mess with da Sandmoon.', 0),
(40522, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Sandfury have changed and want to cooperate? What do they have to sell then? I guess nothing! My friend, you know, Gadgetzan has its reputation. I cannot just let in some filthy sand trolls here.$B$BUnless they pay.$B$BA lot.', 0),
(40523, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Dey be no less insane than our brothers in Zul\'Farrak, mon. Sandmoon be not paying dem, never. If dey want us enemies, so be it.$B$BMy mission still stands.', 0),
(40524, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I require your assistance in helping Sandmoon Village, brave $C.', 0),
(40525, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'That be good. I think. We Sandfury be never open to da outsiders. But these be different times now. As Maz\'ek be sayin\': we have to change or face extinction. I wish I could speak to Vol\'jin myself about our... cooperation. I cannot leave my people yet though. I be needed here. I be needed here as long as Chief Ukorz lives and my people are in danger.', 0),
(40526, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It does not bring me joy to hear about de death of my kin. It be necesarry, sadly. It is de only way for Sandfury to survive.', 0),
(40527, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So it is done, I Thank you.$B$BUkorz Sandscalp was not always so brutal and cold, his mind be warped from the magic he and his lackeys dabbled within\'. It almost be sad to think of what a promisin\' future he brought when he first became chief, for it all to drift away like sand on de dunes.$B$BPerhaps we find a new future now, all thanks to you mon.', 0),
(40528, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Good, turtle meat for Viceclaw! Ya be useful outsider. Ya can stay, Ekka be likin\' ya.', 0),
(40589, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh baby, its still intact, look at this thing, a bit of heat damage, and some sand where it shouldn\'t be, but its not broken.$B$BYou saved us a heaping pile of gold recovering this thing, and that\'s like giving it to me yourself!$B$BHere, this should make up for the work you did.', 0),
(40590, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, would ye look at these, so bright and shiny, they practically look like golden coins!', 0),
(40591, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Would ye look at that? Well, you actually went ahead and did it then aye?$B$BMe and my benefactors appreciate all the work, this has really scratched off the main difficult things I needed.$B$BWell I suppose you earned something, here, take these, they should do you well, with all your adventuring and what not.', 0),
(40592, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, would ye look at these, so bright and shiny, they practically look like golden coins!', 0),
(41762, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Wonderful, wonderful! Once they start up the stations again, they will create a SPECTACULAR display of pyrodynamics! With this outta the way, all we gotta do is haul the barrels back to... -wait, you\'re still here? Oh, your reward, sure, just give me a second...$B$B<The goblin is rummaging in a small satchel on his belt, before pulling out a gold coin.>$B$BThere you go, don\'t spend everything at once, bozo!', 0),
(41763, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, my beloved, finally back in my arms. I cannot thank you enough, $N. Now I have everything to enjoy my self-assigned vacation from the oil rig - thanks a bunch! Here, let\'s share a drink and toast on the occasion!', 0),
(41764, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So the control panels were tampered with, hm? Not really a surprise, but a nuisance nonetheless. As much as I hate to admit it, our technicians will have to double proof them to ensure their original functionality is being restored. We wouldn\'t want all this liquid gold just to blow up, alongside us!$B$BEither way, good work out there. Here, take these as compensation for the hassle; the Durotar Labor Union is in your favour!', 0),
(41765, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Must\'ve been a breeze, eh? You are more competent than you look. Nert was right in allying with the Horde; not that he had much choice to begin with. Now that the fodder\'s outta the way, time to smoke out their head honcho.', 0),
(41766, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Shrillfluke, eh? Certainly not the biggest fish, but his name was popping up occasionally in Undermine. From what I can read here, their genius plan was to overload the pump stations using some home cooked spell - which of course backfired, typical goblin fashion. Instead all it did was power up the oil itself, leaving us with these troublesome oil oozes sludging around. Annoying, to say the least. Well, let\'s put a bow on this thing, I don\'t wanna waste another minute thinking about the Mogul\'s cronies.', 0),
(41838, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So Blaxbi managed to fulfill his job after all. Excellent. Seeing how you’re still in good shape, you may be useful to us - we’ll see. Take a look around town and see where you can help out. But remember: don’t touch ANYTHING!', 0),
(41985, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Look at that beauty! Sleek design, a wonderful black finish on top and most of all - it won’t explode in my face when I turn it on. Thanks a lot, $N. Now there should be nothing standing in my way to properly prepare Noggenfogger’s banquet.$B$BHere, you can have a copy of the cooker’s blueprints for coming in clutch there. Thanks again, kid!', 0),
(41986, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Those were incredible. You really got a hand for cooking, Dirge has to watch out you’re not dethroning him too soon if those are any indication of your culinary skills. Either way, here is the finished cooker. Bring it to Dirge and tell him he can come back anytime, if his pride as a goblin allows it.', 0),
(60010, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hey, there we are! Thanks! As promised, some money, and some pizza bottles!$B$BOh, I didn\'t mention those?', 0),
(80380, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You got the goods? Sweet! I\'ll get cookin\', but first, I promised you the Saltcrabs formula for a perfect brunch, didn\'t I? Well first, you set down a blanket, then you put up an umbrella! That was worth the effort, now wasn\'t it? Thanks for the meats, $N. I\'m gonna knock the pants off these partygoers!', 0),
(80382, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Sweet, my party\'s gonna rock! I can\'t wait to see what kind of clout these boys bring.$B$BIf they\'re really high rollers, they\'ll buy a whole bar\'s worth of booze.$B$BThanks again for your help. Why don\'t you join us on this beautiful beach front? Not looking like that, though. You\'ve gotta have the right stitching to kick it with me. Take these and put them on.', 0),
(80383, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You did it! Now that shark can get back to its lifestyle as the apex predator in the sea instead of being strung up like a trophy which is what these goblins would have done to it.$B$BI have a little memento for you as a reward. Take good care of it, okay?', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40519, 0, 0, '<The wind howls across the sand.>', 0),
(40520, 1, 0, 'Do ya have da food and skins?', 0),
(40521, 0, 0, 'Our mad brethren in Zul\'Farrak no longer revere our gods as dey should. Only we can stop the ogres.', 0),
(40522, 0, 0, 'What\'s up, pal?', 0),
(40523, 0, 0, 'Have ya speak to da goblins?', 0),
(40524, 0, 0, 'I speak for the Darkspear.', 0),
(40525, 0, 0, 'So ya be the new one among us. Maz\'ek told me he sent you to negotiate with Vol\'jin. Were you successful?', 0),
(40526, 0, 0, 'Have you finished your... grim task?', 0),
(40527, 1, 0, 'Is Ukorz dead?', 0),
(40528, 0, 0, 'You can find da turtles on the shore, next to da port.', 0),
(40589, 0, 0, 'That Turbo-Scan Filtronomitor is state of the art, losing that is like losing twenty goblins.', 0),
(40590, 0, 0, 'Aye, it be hot out there huh?$B$BAny luck with them scales?', 0),
(40591, 0, 0, 'Well I see you\'re not smashed to a pulp, any luck?', 0),
(40592, 0, 0, 'Have you had any luck in finding that fabled Harmonized Sand?', 0),
(41762, 0, 0, 'Are you done yet? Don\'t keep me waiting, buster!', 0),
(41763, 0, 0, 'If you find it, don\'t you dare open it! You are not ready for their... peculiar beauty.', 0),
(41764, 0, 0, 'How is it, any success with the pump stations yet?', 0),
(41765, 0, 0, 'Done with the pest control yet?', 0),
(41766, 0, 0, 'My workers are starting to enjoy their time-off a little too much. Let\'s put an end to this and get back on our quota.', 0),
(41838, 0, 0, 'And who are you? We don’t need bootlickers coming in to waste the boss’ time!', 0),
(41985, 0, 0, 'Do you have the cooker?!', 0),
(41986, 0, 0, 'Dirge is demanding his cooker to be finished immediately? This goblin got some nerve. Coming to me in the first place was a surprise, but then again, gnomish engineering is simply superior to the childish attempts at creating machines these green amateurs are demonstrating. Dirge must have realized it himself eventually. You want to know why? Ask him why he only has three fingers left. There were others before me building his cooker for him, let’s just say that.$B$BRegardless, if he wants it to be done, I need fuel. And I don’t mean crude things like oil or whatnot. No, I require brain fuel in the form of food! My synapses demand the delectable taste of Monster Omelet, a delicacy made from Giant Eggs. Bring me ten and I will finalize his cooker in no time.', 0),
(60010, 4, 6, 'Didja get the flowers?I sure hope Dadanga gives me the recipe for the elixir soon. Almost out of money...', 0),
(80380, 0, 0, 'Time\'s a-tickin\', bub. Can\'t waste what\'s left of it before this big palooza so I can surprise the culprit with my amazing spicy crab souffle. It\'s a cutthroat cooking competition out here that drives people to do these crazy things, $N, but I\'m always one step ahead.', 0),
(80382, 0, 0, 'Hurry up or you\'ll cramp my style! I don\'t want these guys to think I left their invites for last.', 0),
(80383, 0, 0, 'Did you know that sharks have skeletons made of cartilage and not bones?', 0);
